{"slug":"Combat-Warriors-Hitbox-Expander-UPD2-16433","_id":"66a96d8d344792d18d4abfec","title":"Hitbox Expander UPD2","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d23","gameId":4282985734,"name":"Combat Warriors","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":4282985734},"features":"Works on Solara (BOWS AND KUNAI ONLY)\n\nthis script is basically silent aim \n(At 15 like ill release an auto parry script)\n\nSTATUS: WORKING ON SOLARA\n7/30/24\n\n-you can change the hitbox, (code down below)\n\nyou can either paste this in your executer or the \"standard version\"\nchange the, _G.HeadSize = 10 the \"10\" into how much you want, for a bigger hitbox with the bow, or kunai\n\n[DO NOT ABUSE IN GAME]\n\n_G.HeadSize = 10\n_G.Disabled = true\ngame:GetService('RunService').RenderStepped:connect(function()\nif _G.Disabled then\nfor i,v in next, game:GetService('Players'):GetPlayers() do\nif v.Name ~= game:GetService('Players').LocalPlayer.Name then\npcall(function()\nv.Character.Head.Size = Vector3.new(_G.HeadSize,_G.HeadSize,_G.HeadSize)\nv.Character.Head.Transparency = 1\nv.Character.Head.BrickColor = BrickColor.new(\"Red\")\nv.Character.Head.Material = \"Neon\"\nv.Character.Head.CanCollide = false\nv.Character.Head.Massless = true\nend)\nend\nend\nend\nend)","tags":[],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://scriptblox.com/raw/Combat-Warriors-ranged-hitbox-expander-10430\"))()","owner":{"_id":"66750d4a25b1ce2b50bd0913","username":"wokhard213","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/90ce552db9c6786ca8c9ff440d77ddaeffc147d9c3869f584635c09ad1255230.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/66750d4a25b1ce2b50bd0913-1722311866479.jpg"},"status":"offline","id":"66750d4a25b1ce2b50bd0913","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":5},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/90ce552db9c6786ca8c9ff440d77ddaeffc147d9c3869f584635c09ad12552